  "body": "Title and CCC are issued and ready to move in\r\n\r\nEffortless Sophistication | Coastal Convenience | Uncompromising Quality\r\n\r\nWelcome to 28 Stapleford Crescent—an exclusive, boutique development featuring three brand-new, architecturally designed residences built for those who demand executive quality, clever floor plans, and coastal convenience. Standing proudly in a quiet, sought-after Browns Bay pocket, these contemporary homes combine striking modern exteriors with warm, refined interior luxury.\r\n\r\nLot 2: The Sleek Executive\r\n\r\n4 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage\r\n\r\n• Low-Maintenance Luxury: Perfect for busy professionals or lock-and-leave lifestyles without sacrificing bedroom count or living space.\r\n• Smart Design: Features an effortless open-plan flow, guest powder room on the main level, and a master suite complete with a private ensuite.\r\n\r\nKey Development Features\r\n\r\n• Gourmet Chef's Kitchens: Equipped with premium gas cooking, sleek stone waterfall countertops, ambient under-cabinet LED lighting, and a custom built-in bar with dedicated wine storage.\r\n• Designer Bathrooms: Fully tiled floor-to-ceiling bathrooms complete with frameless glass showers, back-lit LED round mirrors, and high-end black tapware.\r\n• EV-Ready Garaging & Laundry: Fully carpeted internal-access garages featuring built-in laundry cabinetry, sink setups, and dedicated electrical plugs for EV/car charging.\r\n• Seamless Indoor-Outdoor Flow: Expansive sliding glass doors open onto sunny timber decking—ideal for summer barbecues and alfresco dining.\r\n• Top School Zones: In-zone for premier North Shore schools, including Sherwood School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College.\r\n• Year-Round Comfort: High-spec heat pumps, double-glazed windows, plush carpeting, and light oak-toned flooring throughout.\r\n\r\nPrime Browns Bay Location\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of North Shore coastal living. Located just minutes from vibrant Browns Bay Village, picturesque beaches, popular cafes, boutique shops, and local parks, 28 Stapleford Crescent blends peace and seclusion with total everyday convenience.",
